# drivetrain-core task 1.2: shared ESP-IDF sdkconfig defaults for BOTH the
# teleop and production firmware environments (design.md File Structure
# Plan: "sdkconfig.defaults # 両ファーム共通").
#
# Intentionally empty of settings for now -- no requirement in this Spec
# calls for a value shared by both firmware builds. This file exists so
# that:
#   - [env:teleop] can rely on ESP-IDF's implicit single-file fallback
#     (tools/cmake/project.cmake picks up ${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/sdkconfig.
#     defaults automatically when no SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS override is given).
#   - [env:production] layers sdkconfig.defaults.production on top of this
#     file via an explicit -DSDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS list (see platformio.ini
#     [env:production] board_build.cmake_extra_args).
#
# Do not add teleop-only or production-only settings here -- those belong
# in sdkconfig.defaults.<env> instead (requirement 1.4;
# design.md BuildSkeleton).
